  {
   "Id": "m0153:0x060011D4",
   "ProposedName": "SendRawBytesAsync",
   "Reason": "Sends one binary WebSocket message only when the client is open. Missing/non-open clients complete without a send. Catches most transport errors, records selected exceptions and raises Closed unless disposing; socket-backed IO errors attempt disposal and raise Closed unconditionally. Exceptions from handlers/diagnostics may still fault the task. Existing misleading ReceiveAsync log text is unchanged.",
   "Source": [
    {
     "Id": "m0153:0x060011D4",
     "Path": "Knx.Falcon.2/KnxnetIp/WebSocketCommunication.cs",
     "Line": 428,
