  {
   "Id": "m0153:0x060011D1",
   "ProposedName": "ReceiveLoopAsync",
   "Reason": "Receives into a 4096-byte buffer with no cancellation token while the socket is open. On EndOfMessage, delivers only the current receive Count bytes; earlier fragments are not accumulated. CloseStatus ends the inner loop. Handles cancellation/transport errors and may dispose before Closed; the disposal path awaits the retained receive task, so its potential self-await is preserved for final behavior verification.",
   "Source": [
